    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Night elf</em></p><p>Your connection to your kin deepens, unlocking unique gifts. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>Increase your Intelligence or Wisdom score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p></li><li><p>You have advantage on Dexterity (Stealth) checks made in dim or unlit areas.</p></li><li><p>When you fail a death saving throw, you may call upon a wisp to change the dice to a success. The essence of the wisp continues to linger in your body for your next two long rests, making you unable to call for anothers aid.</p></li></ul>",
